197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 115 0 R
/T (The LoRa-based Smart Water Meter enables utilities and municipalities to transform traditional water metering into a connected, intelligent, and data-driven system. Designed for modern smart city infrastructure, it delivers accurate, real-time consumption data without the need for manual meter reading.  Powered by low-power, long-range LoRa communication, the meter ensures reliable data transmission across wide urban and rural areas while operating for years on a single battery. This significantly reduces maintenance effort, field visits, and total operational costs.)
/E (The LoRa-based Smart Water Meter enables utilities and municipalities to transform traditional water metering into a connected, intelligent, and data-driven system. Designed for modern smart city infrastructure, it delivers accurate, real-time consumption data without the need for manual meter reading.  Powered by low-power, long-range LoRa communication, the meter ensures reliable data transmission across wide urban and rural areas while operating for years on a single battery. This significantly reduces maintenance effort, field visits, and total operational costs.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
